    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587760/extras/b19cf6deebe30c50656bd11cbb347448.avif?t=1745964049\" data-has-big width=800 height=316 /></span>Sime Is Back<i> </i>18+  takes the beloved retro-inspired platformer into full chaos! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a sprawling underground temple and travel to a different worlds, collect shiny diamonds and keys, and unlock new levels in a mysterious world hub packed with that nostalgic charm you\u2019ve come to love. It\u2019s everything you\u2019d expect from a fun, lighthearted 3D platformer\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until it isn\u2019t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What awaits behind the final doors is nothing you could have anticipated. The game takes a sharp, unexpected turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Classic 3D Platforming\u2026 at First</strong> \u2013 Run, jump, and collect in a nostalgic adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Solve Creative, Action-Based Puzzles</strong> - Defeat enemies and progress through the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd11 <strong>A World Hub</strong> \u2013 Unlock new areas and uncover the mysteries of the underground temple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e <strong>Collect Diamonds</strong> - Progress and unlock bonuses throughout the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc40 <strong>A Completely Normal Ending\u2026</strong> \u2013 Nothing weird happens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587760/extras/e8f3ec6606ac6903371ccb3b82ca9093.avif?t=1745964049\" data-has-big width=800 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587760/extras/b19cf6deebe30c50656bd11cbb347448.avif?t=1745964049\" data-has-big width=800 height=316 /></span>Sime Is Back<i> </i>18+  takes the beloved retro-inspired platformer into full chaos! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a sprawling underground temple and travel to a different worlds, collect shiny diamonds and keys, and unlock new levels in a mysterious world hub packed with that nostalgic charm you\u2019ve come to love. It\u2019s everything you\u2019d expect from a fun, lighthearted 3D platformer\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until it isn\u2019t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What awaits behind the final doors is nothing you could have anticipated. The game takes a sharp, unexpected turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Classic 3D Platforming\u2026 at First</strong> \u2013 Run, jump, and collect in a nostalgic adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Solve Creative, Action-Based Puzzles</strong> - Defeat enemies and progress through the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd11 <strong>A World Hub</strong> \u2013 Unlock new areas and uncover the mysteries of the underground temple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e <strong>Collect Diamonds</strong> - Progress and unlock bonuses throughout the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc40 <strong>A Completely Normal Ending\u2026</strong> \u2013 Nothing weird happens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587760/extras/e8f3ec6606ac6903371ccb3b82ca9093.avif?t=1745964049\" data-has-big width=800 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
